{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 16:23:52.964748", "event": "llm_end", "text": "### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\n\n#### Network Description\nThe network is based on a scalable SDN spine-leaf topology. It includes:\n- **OVS Switches**: `leaf_1`, `leaf_2`, `spine_1`\n- **Hosts**: `host_1_1`, `host_1_2`, `host_2_1`, `host_2_2`\n- **Subnets**:\n  - Host subnet: `10.0.0.0/24`\n  - Management subnet: `20.0.0.0/24`\n- **SDN Controller**: Located at `20.0.0.100`, managing switches via OpenFlow.\n\n#### Reachability Test Results\nThe reachability test was conducted between hosts in the network. Below are the findings:\n\n1. **Host-to-Host Connectivity**:\n   - **`host_1_1` to `host_2_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\n   - **`host_1_2` to `host_1_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\n   - **`host_1_2` to `host_2_1`**: Status is `ok`. 2 packets were transmitted and received successfully with 0% packet loss. RTT statistics:\n     - Average RTT: 4.486 ms\n     - Minimum RTT: 1.902 ms\n     - Maximum RTT: 7.071 ms\n     - RTT Mean Deviation: 2.584 ms\n   - **`host_2_1` to `host_1_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\n   - **`host_2_2` to `host_1_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\n   - **`host_2_2` to `host_2_1`**: Status is `ok`. 2 packets were transmitted and received successfully with 0% packet loss. RTT statistics:\n     - Average RTT: 3.639 ms\n     - Minimum RTT: 0.908 ms\n     - Maximum RTT: 6.37 ms\n     - RTT Mean Deviation: 2.731 ms\n\n#### Observations\n1. **Connectivity Issues**:\n   - Several host-to-host connections are marked as `unknown`, indicating potential anomalies in the network. Specifically:\n     - `host_1_1` is unable to communicate with `host_2_1`.\n     - `host_1_2` is unable to communicate with `host_1_1`.\n     - `host_2_1` is unable to communicate with `host_1_1`.\n     - `host_2_2` is unable to communicate with `host_1_1`.\n\n2. **Successful Connections**:\n   - `host_1_2` successfully communicates with `host_2_1`.\n   - `host_2_2` successfully communicates with `host_2_1`.\n\n3. **RTT Analysis**:\n   - The RTT values for successful connections are within acceptable ranges, with no packet loss observed.\n\n#### Diagnosis Summary\nThe network exhibits partial connectivity issues. While some host-to-host connections are functional, others fail to establish communication. The root cause of these anomalies needs further investigation, focusing on:\n- Host `host_1_1`, which appears to be isolated.\n- The underlying SDN controller and OpenFlow rules.\n- The spine-leaf topology and switch configurations.\n\nFurther analysis is required to localize the faulty devices and identify the root cause of the connectivity issues.", "generation_info": {"finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3264, "output_tokens": 799, "total_tokens": 4063, "input_token_details": {"audio": 0, "cache_read": 2688}, "output_token_details": {"audio": 0, "reasoning": 0}}}
